do_aniso_mag         "Estimate (anisotropic) magnification?" bool       true            "?"             "?"             "?"             ?               
; If set to Yes, then relion_ctf_refine will also estimate the (anisotropic) magnification per optics group.
This option cannot be done simultaneously with higher-order aberration estimation.
It's probably best to estimate the one that is most off first, and the other one second.
It might be worth repeating the estimation if both are off.
;
