do_4thorder          "Estimate 4th order aberrations?"   bool       false           "?"             "?"             "?"             ?               
; If set to Yes, then relion_ctf_refine will also estimate the Cs and the tetrafoil (4-fold astigmatism) per optics group.
This option is only recommended for data sets that extend beyond 3 Angstrom resolution.
;
